# Settings and credentials of the source modules (sources/escola, sources/moodle; see sources/README.md).
# Copy to .env in this folder (the Family Campus folder) and fill in what my-family uses; leave the rest commented.
# .env is never committed, never copied into the Docker image and never passed to the container.
# The logins of the site itself are not here: they are in <campus>/data/campus.env.

# --- Escola (sources/escola/README.md) – your parent account ---
# ESCOLA_URL=https://www.your-school.ch
# ESCOLA_USERNAME=
# ESCOLA_PASSWORD=
# Children whose learning goals are fetched (first names as shown in Escola)
# ESCOLA_CHILDREN=Anna,Ben
# Optional: "stay logged in" in hours (default 720 = 30 days); fewer logins = fewer Escola e-mails
# ESCOLA_LOGIN_HOURS=720

# --- Moodle (sources/moodle/README.md) – the learner's own account ---
# The learner runs  python3 sources/moodle/moodle.py token --person Ben  himself;
# only the token is stored (<campus>/material/moodle/ben/.token), never the password.
# Learners with a Moodle account (names as in campus.json), then per learner (first name in capitals):
# MOODLE_PEOPLE=Ben
# MOODLE_BEN_URL=https://moodle.your-school.ch
# Optional, entered by the learner: calendar export link or security key (single sign-on)
# MOODLE_BEN_ICAL=
# MOODLE_BEN_TOKEN=
